    "A song counts once you've heard half of it, or four minutes, whichever is first. Videos aren't scrobbled. Plays wait on this iPhone while you're offline and send in order later, with the time you played them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A song counts once you've heard half of it, or four minutes, whichever is first. Videos aren't scrobbled. Plays wait on this iPhone while you're offline and send in order later, with the time you played them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "歌曲播放至一半或四分鐘時便會記錄，以先達到者為準。影片不會記錄。離線時，播放紀錄會暫存於這部 iPhone，之後依序傳送，並附上實際播放時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A song counts once you've heard half of it, or four minutes. Videos aren't scrobbled. Offline plays wait on this Mac and send in order later.": {
