    "Adds liked songs, listening history and stats, searches, the playlists you made and the albums and playlists you saved from a Koda for Android backup file. Nothing here is replaced. Videos, subscriptions, settings and songs that were files on the phone stay behind.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adds liked songs, listening history and stats, searches, the playlists you made and the albums and playlists you saved from a Koda for Android backup file. Nothing here is replaced. Videos, subscriptions, settings and songs that were files on the phone stay behind."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從 Android 版 Koda 備份檔加入喜歡的歌曲、聆聽紀錄與統計、搜尋紀錄、你建立的播放清單，以及已儲存的專輯與播放清單。現有內容不會被取代。影片、訂閱、設定與手機上的本機歌曲檔案不會匯入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds the song playing now to your liked songs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adds the song playing now to your liked songs."
