        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將正在播放的歌曲加入喜歡的歌曲。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjusting a band creates a custom curve. The graph includes bass boost; the sliders show the underlying EQ values.": {
