    "Covers are kept so pages open quickly and work with a weak connection. Cleared, they download again as you browse. Koda never keeps more than 300 MB.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Covers are kept so pages open quickly and work with a weak connection. Cleared, they download again as you browse. Koda never keeps more than 300 MB."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "封面會暫存以加快頁面開啟速度，並在連線不佳時繼續顯示。清除後，瀏覽時會重新下載。Koda 最多保留 300 MB 的封面快取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Covers are kept so pages open quickly. Cleared, they download again as you browse. Never more than 300 MB.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Covers are kept so pages open quickly. Cleared, they download again as you browse. Never more than 300 MB."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "儲存封面以加快頁面載入速度。清除後，會在瀏覽時重新下載。最多使用 300 MB。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
