          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "節省數據"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Data Saver streams use about a third of the data, and Low Data Mode always uses it. Downloads and songs kept as you play them are always high quality.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Data Saver streams use about a third of the data, and Low Data Mode always uses it. Downloads and songs kept as you play them are always high quality."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "節省數據的串流約使用三分之一的數據量；低數據模式會一律採用此設定。離線下載及播放時保留的歌曲一律使用高音質。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Data Saver streams use about a third of the data. In Low Data Mode, Koda always uses Data Saver. Downloads and songs kept as you play them are always High Quality, so a Data Saver stream isn't kept.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Data Saver streams use about a third of the data. In Low Data Mode, Koda always uses Data Saver. Downloads and songs kept as you play them are always High Quality, so a Data Saver stream isn't kept."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "節省數據串流約使用三分之一的數據量。在「低數據模式」下，Koda 一律使用節省數據。離線下載與播放時保留的歌曲一律使用高品質，因此不會保留節省數據的串流。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
