    "Headroom protection automatically reduces preamp gain when the curve boosts frequencies. Transient protection prevents digital overload. The output limit controls Koda music only, not other apps or the device volume.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Headroom protection automatically reduces preamp gain when the curve boosts frequencies. Transient protection prevents digital overload. The output limit controls Koda music only, not other apps or the device volume."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "曲線提高頻段增益時，保護機制會自動降低前級增益，並抑制瞬間過載。輸出上限只控制 Koda 音樂，不會調整其他 App 或裝置音量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
