    "Home and the library follow this account. Signing out keeps the profile and everything in it on this Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Home and the library follow this account. Signing out keeps the profile and everything in it on this Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首頁與音樂庫會與此帳號同步。登出後，個人檔案及其中的所有內容仍會保留在這部 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home and your library follow your YouTube Music account. With YouTube history on, songs you play for 15 seconds appear in your history on YouTube Music and shape its recommendations; nothing is sent while Koda's listening history is off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Home and your library follow your YouTube Music account. With YouTube history on, songs you play for 15 seconds appear in your history on YouTube Music and shape its recommendations; nothing is sent while Koda's listening history is off."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首頁與音樂庫會與你的 YouTube Music 帳號同步。開啟 YouTube 紀錄後，播放滿 15 秒的歌曲會出現在 YouTube Music 紀錄中，並影響其推薦內容。關閉 Koda 聆聽紀錄時，不會傳送任何播放紀錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home fills in as you listen. You can pick artists any time in Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Home fills in as you listen. You can pick artists any time in Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首頁會隨著你的聆聽逐漸豐富。你可隨時在設定中選擇藝人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home is built from %@, and gets better the more you listen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
