    "Koda asks every source at once. Word-by-word lyrics win; among equals, the higher source wins. At least one stays on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Koda asks every source at once. Word-by-word lyrics win; among equals, the higher source wins. At least one stays on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Koda 會同時查詢所有來源，優先採用逐字歌詞；相同類型則優先使用排序較前的來源。至少必須啟用一個來源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Koda asks every source at once. Word-by-word lyrics win; among equals, the higher source wins. Drag to reorder. At least one source stays on.": {
