    "Smart Shuffle balances recent plays, repeated songs, artists, likes and skips using only local information. Ordinary Shuffle remains available from the queue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Smart Shuffle balances recent plays, repeated songs, artists, likes and skips using only local information. Ordinary Shuffle remains available from the queue."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智慧隨機播放只使用本機資料，依最近播放、重複歌曲、藝人、喜歡的歌曲與略過紀錄安排順序。你仍可在播放佇列選擇一般隨機播放。"
          }
