    "Songs are kept as you play them, so they start at once next time and play offline. Past the limit, the ones played longest ago go first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Songs are kept as you play them, so they start at once next time and play offline. Past the limit, the ones played longest ago go first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "播放時保留歌曲，方便下次立即播放，也可離線聆聽。超過上限時，會優先移除最久未播放的歌曲。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Songs are kept as you play them, so they start at once next time and play without a connection. Past the limit, the ones played longest ago are removed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Songs are kept as you play them, so they start at once next time and play without a connection. Past the limit, the ones played longest ago are removed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "歌曲會在播放時保留，讓下次播放立即開始，也能離線聆聽。超過容量上限時，最久沒有播放的歌曲會被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
