    "Space or K plays and pauses, J and L skip 10 seconds, ← and → skip 5, F goes full screen and Esc leaves it, M mutes. Double-click a video for full screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Space or K plays and pauses, J and L skip 10 seconds, ← and → skip 5, F goes full screen and Esc leaves it, M mutes. Double-click a video for full screen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空白鍵或 K 可播放與暫停，J 與 L 可跳轉 10 秒，← 與 → 可跳轉 5 秒，F 可進入全螢幕、Esc 可離開，M 可靜音。按兩下影片也可進入全螢幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
