            "value": "The artists, genres and songs Home starts from, before and beside what you play."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首頁會以這些藝人、曲風與歌曲為起點，並結合你的播放紀錄推薦內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The colours of the playing song's cover drift behind Now Playing. Turned off, they hold still. They always hold still with Reduce Motion on.\n\nAnimated Art plays album covers that move, in Now Playing and on the Lock Screen. Koda finds them by looking up the playing song's title and artist in Apple Music's catalogue. Covers already downloaded play on any network.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The colours of the playing song's cover drift behind Now Playing. Turned off, they hold still. They always hold still with Reduce Motion on.\n\nAnimated Art plays album covers that move, in Now Playing and on the Lock Screen. Koda finds them by looking up the playing song's title and artist in Apple Music's catalogue. Covers already downloaded play on any network."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「正在播放」的背景會隨歌曲封面色彩流動。關閉後色彩會保持靜止；開啟「減少動態效果」時也會保持靜止。\n\n動態封面會在「正在播放」與鎖定畫面中播放專輯封面動畫。Koda 會以目前歌曲的名稱和藝人在 Apple Music 目錄中尋找封面。已下載的封面可在任何網路下播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current sound settings stay unchanged.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The current sound settings stay unchanged."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前的音效設定會保持不變。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The endpoint must return LRC, TTML, plain lyrics, or compatible JSON containing lyrics. A normal webpage is not a lyrics endpoint.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The endpoint must return LRC, TTML, plain lyrics, or compatible JSON containing lyrics. A normal webpage is not a lyrics endpoint."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "來源必須回傳 LRC、TTML、純文字歌詞，或含有歌詞的相容 JSON。一般網頁網址無法作為歌詞來源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The equalizer shapes every song you play, from the next moment of the one playing. Songs that are boosted are played a little quieter, so loud ones never distort.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The equalizer shapes every song you play, from the next moment of the one playing. Songs that are boosted are played a little quieter, so loud ones never distort."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等化器會立即套用到正在播放的歌曲，也會套用到之後的每首歌曲。增強音效時會略微降低播放音量，避免較大聲的歌曲失真。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The playing song's colours drift behind Now Playing. They always hold still with Reduce Motion on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The playing song's colours drift behind Now Playing. They always hold still with Reduce Motion on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "歌曲的色彩會在「正在播放」背景緩緩流動。開啟「減少動態效果」時會保持靜止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The second singer's lines sit on the right.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The second singer's lines sit on the right."
