    "Video Mode adds YouTube itself beside your music: a Music and Video switch on Home, with videos, subscriptions and the video player.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Video Mode adds YouTube itself beside your music: a Music and Video switch on Home, with videos, subscriptions and the video player."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "影片模式讓你在聽音樂之餘也能觀看 YouTube。首頁會顯示「音樂」和「影片」切換鈕，提供影片、訂閱內容與影片播放器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Video Mode adds a Music and Video switch on Home. Each video starts at the Default Quality, or the best it has below it; Auto follows the connection. The player's menu changes the quality of the video playing. Double-tap either side of a video to skip 10 seconds, and keep tapping to skip further. Hold to Speed Up plays at 2× while you hold, and sliding sideways changes the speed. Swipe up on a video for full screen and down to leave it; in full screen, Swipe for Brightness sets the screen from the left half, and pinching fills the screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Video Mode adds a Music and Video switch on Home. Each video starts at the Default Quality, or the best it has below it; Auto follows the connection. The player's menu changes the quality of the video playing. Double-tap either side of a video to skip 10 seconds, and keep tapping to skip further. Hold to Speed Up plays at 2× while you hold, and sliding sideways changes the speed. Swipe up on a video for full screen and down to leave it; in full screen, Swipe for Brightness sets the screen from the left half, and pinching fills the screen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "影片模式會在首頁加入「音樂」和「影片」切換鈕。每部影片會以預設畫質或低於該設定的最佳畫質開始播放；「自動」則依連線狀況調整。你可透過播放器選單變更目前影片的畫質。點兩下影片左側或右側可倒轉或快轉 10 秒，繼續點按可跳過更長時間。開啟「按住加速」後，按住影片會以 2 倍速播放，左右滑動可調整速度。向上滑可進入全螢幕，向下滑則離開。在全螢幕模式中，可於左半邊上下滑動調整亮度，或用雙指縮放填滿螢幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
