            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟自動混音或交叉淡入淡出時，跳過歌曲會快速淡出，不會突然中斷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With listening history off, songs you play aren't added to Recently Played, Quick picks, Your Mix or your stats. What is already saved stays until you clear it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With listening history off, songs you play aren't added to Recently Played, Quick picks, Your Mix or your stats. What is already saved stays until you clear it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關閉聆聽紀錄後，播放的歌曲不會加入「最近播放」、「快速推薦」、「專屬合輯」或統計資料。已儲存的內容會保留，直到你手動清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With listening history off, songs you play don't reach Recently Played, Quick picks, Your Mix, your stats, Last.fm or Discord. What's saved stays until you clear it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With listening history off, songs you play don't reach Recently Played, Quick picks, Your Mix, your stats, Last.fm or Discord. What's saved stays until you clear it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關閉聆聽紀錄後，播放的歌曲不會影響最近播放、快速推薦、專屬合輯或聆聽統計，也不會傳送至 Last.fm 或 Discord。現有資料會保留至你手動清除。"
          }
        }
      }
